### Demo Air (XX) — Phase 1 happy path through the gateway (blueprint §12.1)
### Works with Visual Studio 2022 (17.6+), Rider and VS Code "REST Client".
### Run requests top to bottom. If your client does not support {{name.response...}} variables, copy values manually.

@gw = http://localhost:5000
# Pick a date within the next 30 days (flights are seeded for 30 days from the first start).
@travelDate = 2026-12-10

### 1. Anonymous token (session handle)
# @name token
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/v1/token/anonymous
Content-Type: application/json

{ "applicationName": "dotREZWeb" }

### 2. Reference data (ETag cached — send If-None-Match to get 304)
GET {{gw}}/api/nsk/v1/resources/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 3. Availability CMB → DXB (simple search)
# @name avail
POST {{gw}}/api/nsk/v4/availability/search/simple
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "CMB",
  "destination": "DXB",
  "beginDate": "{{travelDate}}",
  "passengers": { "types": [ { "type": "ADT", "count": 1 } ] },
  "numberOfFaresPerJourney": 4
}

### 4. Trip sell (holds inventory until the session expires)
# @name sell
POST {{gw}}/api/nsk/v4/trip/sell
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keys": [
    {
      "journeyKey": "{{avail.response.body.$.data.results[0].trips[0].journeysAvailableByMarket['CMB|DXB'][0].journeyKey}}",
      "fareAvailabilityKey": "{{avail.response.body.$.data.results[0].trips[0].journeysAvailableByMarket['CMB|DXB'][0].fares[0].fareAvailabilityKey}}"
    }
  ],
  "passengers": { "types": [ { "type": "ADT", "count": 1 } ] },
  "currencyCode": "USD"
}

### 5. Passenger details (first adult is always passengerKey MCFBRFQ- = "0!ADT")
PUT {{gw}}/api/nsk/v3/booking/passengers/MCFBRFQ-
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": { "first": "Ashan", "last": "Dias", "title": "MR" },
  "info": { "nationality": "LK", "residentCountry": "LK", "gender": "Male", "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-14" }
}

### 6. Primary contact
POST {{gw}}/api/nsk/v1/booking/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactTypeCode": "P",
  "name": { "first": "Ashan", "last": "Dias" },
  "emailAddress": "ashan@example.com",
  "phoneNumbers": [ { "type": "Mobile", "number": "+94770000000" } ],
  "distributionOption": "Email"
}

### 7. Payment methods for this booking
GET {{gw}}/api/nsk/v2/booking/payments/available
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 8. Pay the balance with a test card (4000000000000002 = declined)
POST {{gw}}/api/nsk/v6/booking/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethodCode": "VI",
  "amount": {{sell.response.body.$.data.breakdown.balanceDue}},
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "paymentFields": {
    "ACCTNO": "4111111111111111",
    "EXPDAT": "12/2030",
    "CC::AccountHolderName": "Ashan Dias",
    "CC::VerificationCode": "123"
  }
}

### 9. Commit → 201, Location: /api/nsk/v1/booking
POST {{gw}}/api/nsk/v3/booking
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "receivedBy": "Web", "comments": [ { "type": "Default", "text": "Booked via booking-flow.http" } ] }

### 10. Status (recordLocator, info.status = 2 Confirmed, paidStatus = 1 PaidInFull)
# @name status
GET {{gw}}/api/nsk/v2/booking/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 11. Log out (releases the session; an itinerary email is in Mailpit http://localhost:8025)
DELETE {{gw}}/api/auth/v1/token
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.data.token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- manage booking

### 12. New anonymous session
# @name token2
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/v1/token/anonymous
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### 13. Retrieve by record locator + last name (loads into state)
GET {{gw}}/api/nsk/v2/booking/retrieve?RecordLocator={{status.response.body.$.data.recordLocator}}&LastName=Dias
Authorization: Bearer {{token2.response.body.$.data.token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- agent

### 14. Agent login (domain DEF, agent01 / Password1!)
# @name agent
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/v1/token/user
Content-Type: application/json

{ "credentials": { "domain": "DEF", "username": "agent01", "password": "Password1!" } }

### 15. Stateless booking read by record locator (agent only)
GET {{gw}}/api/nsk/v1/bookings/{{status.response.body.$.data.recordLocator}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agent.response.body.$.data.token}}
